     'Greenskeeper.org full per-hole grid (listed under the former name ''Split Rail Links & Golf Club''). Primary source for all per-hole yardages, par and both stroke-index rows.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000008', 'other', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/22607-split-rail-golf-club',
     'GolfPass tee sheet. Corroborates all five totals and all rating/slope pairs, and confirms tee genders (four men''s tees + Red women''s). Disagrees with greenskeeper only on the NAMES of the two longest tees (see collection_notes).', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000009', 'other', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/2724-twin-creeks-golf-course',
     'GolfPass tee sheet - source used for the four tee totals, ratings, slopes and genders reported here.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000009', 'other', 'https://golfscorekeeper.com/view_course.cfm?State=TX&Course=13706&Country=210',
     'Golfscorekeeper front/back nine splits. Independently corroborates the three men''s totals (3332+3508=6840, 3068+3220=6288, 2761+2890=5651) though its tee LABELS (Senior/Champ/Mens) are scrambled. Its ratings/slopes disagree with GolfPass and were not used.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000009', 'other', 'https://www.greenskeeper.org/texas/Dallas_Fort_Worth/the_golf_club_at_twin_creeks/scorecard.cfm',
     'REJECTED for per-hole data - has at least four confirmed transcription errors (detailed in collection_notes). Recorded here only so a human can re-transcribe after correcting it against the physical card. Its complete and internally valid stroke-index rows are probably salvageable.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000010', 'other', 'https://www.greenskeeper.org/texas/Dallas_Fort_Worth/cross_timbers_golf_course_texas/scorecard.cfm',
     'Greenskeeper.org full per-hole grid. Primary source for all per-hole yardages, both par rows and both stroke-index rows.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000010', 'other', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/2755-cross-timbers-golf-course',
     'GolfPass tee sheet. Source for the ratings/slopes/genders used here, and an independent check on all four tee totals - all four matched my per-hole sums exactly.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000011', 'other', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/2775-benbrook-3-par',
     'GolfPass (listed as ''Benbrook 3 Par''). Primary source - carries the full per-hole yardage, par and handicap grid plus both gender ratings, unusually complete for a GolfPass page.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000011', 'other', 'https://texasoutside.com/golf-courses/benbrook-par-3-golf-course/',
     'Texas Outside course write-up. Independently confirms the 929-yard total, par 27, the 62-177 yard range, and specifically the 90-yard #3 and 65-yard #7 - both matching the transcribed grid.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000012', 'course_website', 'https://www.whitestonegolf.com/scorecard/',
     'Official scorecard page. Returns HTTP 403 to automated fetch (whole domain does, including /course/). NOT transcribed - flag for human transcription; this is the authoritative source for the missing per-hole yardages.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000012', 'other', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/22642-whitestone-golf-course',
     'Tee sheet: Gold 7117 74.4/135 M, Blue 6615 72.1/128 M, White 6084 69.0/125 M, Red 5201 71.2/125 W. Par 72. Source of the tee/rating data used here.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000012', 'other', 'https://texasoutside.com/golf-courses/whitestone-golf-club/',
     'Independently corroborates the identical four-tee sheet (7117/74.4/135, 6615/72.1/128, 6084/69.0/125, 5201/71.2/125). Also describes a 198-yard par-3 5th, corroborating the par array.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000012', 'other', 'https://www.hole19golf.com/courses/whitestone-golf-club',
     'Source of the per-hole par and stroke-index arrays. Its yardage row is labelled ''Blue 6048'' which matches no published Whitestone tee, so its yardages were deliberately NOT transcribed. Fetched twice with identical output.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000012', 'other', 'https://18birdies.com/golf-courses/club/8cbb9cc0-86ac-11e4-8c28-020000005b00/whitestone-golf-club',
     'Page returns HTTP 500 to fetch; search-result summary quoted partial Gold data (1: par 5/555, 2: par 4/372, 3: par 3/144, 4: par 4/413, 5: par 3/198, 6: par 4/478) and Gold 7117 rating 75.5 slope 137 - a different rating revision than GolfPass. Used only as corroboration, not transcribed.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000013', 'scorecard_image', 'https://hiddencreekgc.com/wp-content/uploads/2020/11/HiddenCreekScorecard.pdf',
     'Official printed scorecard, image-based PDF (internal timestamp ''Hidden Creek Scorecard Inside.pdf 9/5/2012''). Rendered and read directly. Source of ALL per-hole yardages, par and handicap here. Carries Black/Blue/White/Red rows plus one undifferentiated PAR row and one HANDICAP row; Silver is not printed on it.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000013', 'course_website', 'https://hiddencreekgc.com/course-details/',
     'Official rating/slope/yardage table, verified verbatim on a second fetch: Black 130/74.2/7024, Blue 123/72.2/6563, White 114/69.3/5943, Silver 114/65.9/5605, Red 124/71.2/5272. Source of all ratings here. Table gives no gender labels.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000013', 'other', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/2801-hidden-creek-golf-club',
     'Corroborates the same five tee totals and par 72, and labels Black/Blue/White as Men, Red as Women, Silver as mixed/unrated. Its hole-by-hole prose is unreliable (claims hole 8 is a 448-yard par 3) and was not used.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000013', 'other', 'https://www.greenskeeper.org/texas/Dallas_Fort_Worth/hidden_creek_golf_course_burleson_tx/scorecard.cfm',
     'SUPERSEDED - DO NOT USE. Carries a complete, internally consistent grid for a PAR 71 layout (Black 6829/73.8/139, Blue 6369/70.9/133, White 5734/67.8/120, Red 5003/66.7/110) which is the pre-2012 course. Rejected in favour of the official post-renovation card.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000014', 'other', 'https://www.greenskeeper.org/texas/Dallas_Fort_Worth/southern_oaks_golf_club_burleson_texas/scorecard.cfm',
     'Full per-hole grid - source of every yardage, par and handicap here. Four tee rows (Green/Black/White/Red) plus ''White - Ladies'' and ''Red - Ladies'' rows that repeat the identical yardages, i.e. women''s ratings over the same tees, so they were folded into one tee each rather than duplicated.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000014', 'other', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/2802-southern-oaks-golf-tennis-club',
     'Independent tee sheet. Ratings/slopes match greenskeeper EXACTLY on all six lines (Green 76.0/135 M, Black 74.4/131 M, White 70.8/129 M, White 77.7/142 W, Red 66.4/117 M, Red 72.6/127 W) and confirms the M/W attribution and par 72. Its totals differ slightly (7311/6961/6248/5325).', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000014', 'course_website', 'https://www.southernoaksgolf.com/',
     'Official site returns HTTP 403 to automated fetch; no scorecard could be read from it. Worth a human check to confirm current tee names and totals after the ownership change.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000014', 'other', 'https://www.golflink.com/golf-courses/tx/burleson/southern-oaks-golf-club',
     'Blocked to fetch; search summary only. Quotes the longest tee as ''Gold 7,311, rating 76, slope 135'' and elsewhere ''7,302 yards, par 71'' - contradictory, and it names the back tee Gold rather than Green. Not used.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000015', 'other', 'https://18birdies.com/golf-courses/club/e7fc2300-b4b3-11ed-8987-06780482e2ce/sand-hills-golf-country-club',
     'Source of the per-hole Blue yardages, par, stroke index, and all four rating lines. Rating table re-fetched verbatim with identical output: Blue M 3000/36.1/118, Blue W 3000/36.9/125, Red M 2459/33.7/108, Red W 2459/34.0/115.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000015', 'other', 'https://9holegolfcourses.com/course/14823/Sand-Hills-Golf-Country-Club.html',
     'Source of the Red (ladies'') per-hole yardages: 306 295 137 314 276 260 288 142 441 = 2459. Independently reproduces the men''s row and par row identically to 18Birdies. Publishes no handicaps or ratings.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000015', 'course_website', 'https://sandhillscountryclub.com/golf-course/',
     'Official page. Confirms regulation 9 holes, par 36, and three individual holes hole-for-hole: ''the 270 yard, par 4 No. 6'', ''the most difficult hole, the 220-yard par 3'' at No. 8, and No. 4 as a 470-yard par 5 ''best birdie opportunity''. Quotes 6,090 yards for 18 (the nine played twice off two tee sets). No scorecard table.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000015', 'other', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/12685-sand-hills-golf-country-club',
     'Reproduces the same nine yardages and pars, but names the long tee ''White'' at 3,045 with rating 35.4 / slope 121 and Red (W) 2,459 with 33.0 / 107 - a different tee name and a different rating set than 18Birdies. Not used; recorded as the conflict.', '2026-07-29'),
