    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000019', 'other', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/12689-cleburne-golf-links',
     'GolfPass. Corroborates the six-tee structure and the Gold/Red rating pairs, and independently confirms the per-hole par row and the women''s handicap row. Its men''s back-nine handicap row is shifted by one position and its Black/Blue/White ratings disagree with the official card - not used.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000019', 'other', 'https://www.greenskeeper.org/texas/Dallas_Fort_Worth/cleburne_golf_links_texas/scorecard.cfm',
     'Greenskeeper.org. Confirms Black/Blue/White/Red per-hole yardages exactly, but omits all handicaps (''coming soon''), omits the Gold and Silver tees, and publishes ratings (74.0/126, 72.2/122, 69.6/116, 71.0/119) that disagree with the official card - superseded.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000020', 'course_website', 'https://www.golfcedarcrest.com/golf-course/course-details',
     'PRIMARY. Official course-details page publishes the complete HTML grid: single Par column, single HDCP column, and per-hole yardages for all five tees (Tournament/Black/Gold/Silver/Ruby), plus the tee table with rating/slope. All per-hole data above is transcribed from this page.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000020', 'course_website', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/2864-cedar-crest-golf-course',
     'Used ONLY to split the ratings by gender (Black/Gold/Silver/Ruby each carry a men''s and a women''s rating; Tournament is men''s only). Its men''s numbers match the official site exactly. Note it lists Black total as 6573 and Tournament par as 73, both of which disagree with the official card - not used.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000020', 'other', 'https://www.greenskeeper.org/texas/Dallas_Fort_Worth/Cedar_Crest_Golf_Course/scorecard.cfm',
     'CONFLICTING / STALE. Publishes a different, internally-consistent card: tees Diamond 6505 (71.7/133), Gold 6104 (69.3/123), Silver 5628 (67.6/113), Ruby 4969. Per-hole yardages differ throughout. Its par rows (men and women, identical) match the par-71 version used above. Handicap rows read ''Coming Soon'' - no stroke index available there. Not used for yardages.', '2026-07-29'),
