    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000074', 'course_website', 'https://www.golfpass.com/travel-advisor/courses/3069-kings-creek-country-club',
     'GolfPass. Ratings agree exactly with greenskeeper (Blue 72.0/124, White 69.4/118, Red 68.0/113) and it is the ONLY source for the Gold tee (M 64.6/109, W 70.2/120) - adopted for that tee''s ratings. Its per-hole grid, however, is an older/shorter measurement (Blue 6,314, White 5,951, Gold 5,106, Red 4,587); each row is internally consistent but none matches the current published totals, so those lengths were not used.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000074', 'course_website', 'https://playkingscreek.com/',
     'Official Kings Creek site. Confirms address 6025 Club Dr. Kemp, TX 75143 and phone 903.498.8888, par 71, 179 acres, lit driving range, semi-private with public rates ($40 weekday / $40-55 weekend). Its scorecard is behind a pop-up viewer and yielded no machine-readable per-hole text; the page''s loose ''~5,000 yards'' prose is marketing copy, not a tee measurement.', '2026-07-29'),
    ('00000000-0000-4000-8000-000700000074', 'course_website', 'https://www.texasgolf.com/golfcourses/7701',
